  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8450;</mi><mo>:</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>Re</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
